{"sha": "27704436f01d7a0730500bde765006ae91db569f54261481e1258540e5462123", "body": ["公式表明：当 $y > x$ 时，压强随 $x$ 增大 ---", "加入在蒸气中富集的组分，会使液体更易", "挥发，这就是柯诺瓦洛夫第一定律。", "", "\\begin{example}[乙醇与水]\\label{ex:b2:liquid-vapour-diagrams:ethanol-water}", "乙醇与水对拉乌尔定律呈正偏差，在大气压下形成共沸物，", "其中乙醇的质量分数为 95~\\%。取 $M = 46.07$ 及", "\\qty{18.02}{g/mol}，乙醇的摩尔分数为", "\\[", "  x_{\\text{共沸}} = \\frac{95/46.07}{95/46.07 + 5/18.02} = 0.881 .", "\\]", "其沸点略低于纯乙醇（\\qty{78.3}{\\degreeCelsius}）。下图", "由一参数活度模型计算得到，$\\ln\\gamma_1 = A(1 -", "x)^2$，$\\ln\\gamma_2 = Ax^2$，其参数（$A = 1.09$）经拟合使", "共沸物恰好位于该组成处：模型再现了形状，", "并将共沸物置于 \\qty{77.9}{\\degreeCelsius}。", "% ledger: azeo:ethanol-water.w, aw:C, aw:H, aw:O, antoine:ethanol.A, antoine:ethanol.B, antoine:ethanol.C, antoine:water.A, antoine:water.B, antoine:water.C", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omphase, width=0.47\\linewidth, height=6cm, ymin=76, ymax=101,", "  xlabel={$x$, $y$（乙醇）}, ylabel={$T$ (\\unit{\\degreeCelsius})},", "  title={\\small 乙醇--水（模型）}]", "\\addplot[omliquidus] table[x=x, y=T] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-liquid-vapour-c.dat};", "\\addplot[omsolidus] table[x=y, y=T] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-liquid-vapour-c.dat};", "\\fill (axis cs:0.881,77.92) circle (1.5pt);", "\\draw[densely dotted] (axis cs:0.881,77.92) -- (axis cs:0.881,76);", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=south] at (axis cs:0.80,80.5) {共沸物};", "\\draw[thin] (axis cs:0.80,80.5) -- (axis cs:0.875,78.2);", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (axis cs:0.25,79.5) {液体};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (axis cs:0.5,95) {蒸气};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}\\hfill", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omphase, width=0.47\\linewidth, height=6cm, ymin=78, ymax=120,", "  xlabel={$x$, $y$（组分 1）}, ylabel={$T$ (\\unit{\\degreeCelsius})},", "  title={\\small 负偏差（模型）}]", "\\addplot[omliquidus] table[x=x, y=T] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-liquid-vapour-d.dat};", "\\addplot[omsolidus] table[x=y, y=T] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-liquid-vapour-d.dat};", "\\fill (axis cs:0.29,116.7) circle (1.5pt);", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=west] at (axis cs:0.33,118) {共沸物};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (axis cs:0.6,85) {液体};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (axis cs:0.75,116) {蒸气};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 左：大气压下的乙醇--水，由一参数模型", "拟合共沸物组成（0.881）；共沸物的沸点低于", "两种纯液体。右：一组具有强负偏差的模型体系，", "（$A = -2.0$，苯与甲苯的蒸气压）；共沸物的沸点", "高于两者。}", "% ledger: azeo:ethanol-water.w, antoine:ethanol.A, antoine:water.A (model in figdata/bachelor-2/liquid-vapour.py)", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{分馏}", "", "\\begin{definition}[分馏]\\label{def:b2:liquid-vapour-diagrams:fractional-distillation}", "\\emph{分馏}\\index{分馏}是在塔中分离液体混合物各组分的", "过程：塔内上升的蒸气与下降的液体", "反复接触。\\emph{理论", "塔板}\\index{理论塔板}是塔中的一级，其离开的蒸气", "与液体彼此处于平衡。\\emph{回流", "比}\\index{回流比}是返回塔顶的冷凝液量，", "与作为馏出液采出的量之比。", "\\end{definition}", "", "在每一块塔板上，由下方上升的蒸气穿过上方下降的液体鼓泡；", "离开时，蒸气中轻组分更富集，液体则更贫。在塔顶，蒸气被冷凝，", "其中一部分作为回流返回，其余作为馏出液采出；在塔底，", "再沸器使部分液体沸腾。在", "\\textit{全回流}时不采出任何物质，此时塔的效率最高，", "离开某一塔板的蒸气组成与落到该塔板上的液体组成", "相同。", "", "", "对于理想体系，\\textit{相对挥发度} $\\alpha = p_1^*/p_2^*$", "在塔内变化很小：从苯的沸点处的 2.60 变到", "甲苯沸点处的 2.35。在每一块理论塔板上", "\\[", "  \\frac{y}{1 - y} = \\frac{xp_1^*}{(1 - x)p_2^*} = \\alpha\\,\\frac{x}{1 - x} .", "\\]", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{minipage}[b]{0.58\\linewidth}\\centering", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, >={Stealth}, scale=0.8, every node/.style={transform shape}]", "  \\draw[thick, fill=gray!8] (0,0) rectangle (1.8,7);", "  \\foreach \\k in {1,...,6} {", "    \\pgfmathsetmacro{\\yy}{\\k}", "    \\ifodd\\k", "      \\draw[thick] (0,\\yy) -- (1.45,\\yy); \\draw[thick] (1.45,\\yy) -- (1.45,\\yy-0.55);", "    \\else", "      \\draw[thick] (0.35,\\yy) -- (1.8,\\yy); \\draw[thick] (0.35,\\yy) -- (0.35,\\yy-0.55);", "    \\fi", "    \\fill[omDef!25] (0.02,\\yy) rectangle (1.78,\\yy+0.12);", "  }", "  \\foreach \\k in {1,...,6} \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=east] at (-0.1,\\k) {塔板 \\k};", "  \\draw[->, thick, omThm] (0.9,7.0) -- (0.9,7.9) -- (2.8,7.9);", "  \\draw[thick, fill=white] (2.8,7.6) rectangle (3.6,8.2);", "  \\node[anchor=west, font=\\scriptsize] at (3.65,7.9) {冷凝器};", "  \\draw[->, thick, omDef] (3.2,7.6) -- (3.2,5.6);", "  \\draw[thick, fill=omDef!20] (2.7,5.0) rectangle (3.7,5.6);", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=west] at (3.75,5.3) {回流罐};", "  \\draw[->, thick, omDef] (2.7,5.3) -- (2.1,5.3) -- (2.1,6.6) -- (1.8,6.6);", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=west, omDef] at (2.15,6.1) {回流};", "  \\draw[->, thick, omDef] (3.2,5.0) -- (3.2,4.4) -- (4.4,4.4) node[right] {馏出液};", "  \\draw[->, thick] (-2.2,3.5) -- (0,3.5) node[pos=0, left] {进料};", "  \\draw[thick, fill=omDef!20] (0.2,-1.3) rectangle (1.6,-0.6);", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (0.9,-0.95) {再沸器};", "  \\draw[thick, omDef] (0.9,0) -- (0.9,-0.6);", "  \\draw[->, thick, omThm] (1.6,-0.8) -- (2.1,-0.8) -- (2.1,0.4) -- (1.8,0.4);", "  \\draw[->, thick, omDef] (0.9,-1.3) -- (0.9,-1.8) -- (2.6,-1.8) node[right] {釜底液};", "  \\draw[->, omThm, thick] (2.6,1.5) -- (2.6,3.0) node[midway, right, font=\\scriptsize, align=left] {蒸气\\\\ 上升};", "  \\draw[->, omDef, thick] (-1.4,5.8) -- (-1.4,4.3) node[midway, left, font=\\scriptsize, align=right] {液体\\\\ 下落};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "\\end{minipage}\\hfill", "\\begin{minipage}[b]{0.34\\linewidth}\\centering", "\\includegraphics[width=\\linewidth]{images/book3/refinery-column.jpg}", "\\end{minipage}", ""]}